WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.333
IGP is evaluated on five graph benchmarks: the
citation networks Cora, Citeseer,

00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:08.310
and PubMed, the large social network Reddit,

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.558
and the Open Graph Benchmark dataset ogbn-arxiv.

00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:16.971
Crucially, the budget is defined as true annotation
cost, not a count of labels,

00:00:17.051 --> 00:00:20.625
since an exact query is far pricier than a binary one.

00:00:20.705 --> 00:00:23.940
Budgets vary from two to twenty labels per class.
